Type: C<String>

Characters to not transform when masking.

=item * C<< $msg->common_characters_to_ignore() >> / C<< $msg->common_characters_to_ignore($value) >>

Type: C<Enum> (L<Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::CharsToIgnore::CommonCharsToIgnore>)

Common characters to not transform when masking. Useful to avoid removing
