=item * C<FFX_COMMON_NATIVE_ALPHABET_UNSPECIFIED> => C<0>

=item * C<NUMERIC> => C<1>

=item * C<HEXADECIMAL> => C<2>

=item * C<UPPER_CASE_ALPHA_NUMERIC> => C<3>

=item * C<ALPHA_NUMERIC> => C<4>

=back

=head2 Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::Dlp::CryptoKey

This is a data encryption key (DEK) (as opposed to
a key encryption key (KEK) stored by Cloud Key Management Service
(Cloud KMS).
When using Cloud KMS to wrap or unwrap a DEK, be sure to set an appropriate
IAM policy on the KEK to ensure an attacker cannot
unwrap the DEK.

