=back

=head2 Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::Dlp::FieldTransformation

The transformation to apply to the field.

Inherits from L<Protobuf::Message>.

=head3 Accessors

=over 4

=item * C<< $msg->fields() >> / C<< $msg->fields($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::Storage::FieldId>)

Required. Input field(s) to apply the transformation to.
When you have columns that reference their position within a list,
omit the index from the FieldId. FieldId name matching ignores the index.
For example, instead of "contact.nums[0].type", use "contact.nums.type".

=item * C<< $msg->condition() >> / C<< $msg->condition($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::Dlp::RecordCondition>)

