=head2 Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::Dlp::JobTrigger

Contains a configuration to make API calls on a repeating basis.
See
https://docs.cloud.google.com/sensitive-data-protection/docs/concepts-job-triggers
to learn more.

Inherits from L<Protobuf::Message>.

=head3 Accessors

=over 4

=item * C<< $msg->name() >> / C<< $msg->name($value) >>

Type: C<String>

Output only. Unique resource name for the triggeredJob, assigned by the
service when the triggeredJob is created, for example
`projects/dlp-test-project/jobTriggers/53234423`.

=item * C<< $msg->display_name() >> / C<< $msg->display_name($value) >>

Type: C<String>

Display name (max 100 chars)

=item * C<< $msg->description() >> / C<< $msg->description($value) >>

Type: C<String>

User provided description (max 256 chars)

=item * C<< $msg->inspect_job() >> / C<< $msg->inspect_job($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::Dlp::InspectJobConfig>)

For inspect jobs, a snapshot of the configuration.

=item * C<< $msg->triggers() >> / C<< $msg->triggers($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::Dlp::JobTrigger::Trigger>)

A list of triggers which will be OR'ed together. Only one in the list
needs to trigger for a job to be started. The list may contain only
a single Schedule trigger and must have at least one object.

=item * C<< $msg->errors() >> / C<< $msg->errors($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::Dlp::Error>)

Output only. A stream of errors encountered when the trigger was activated.
Repeated errors may result in the JobTrigger automatically being paused.
Will return the last 100 errors. Whenever the JobTrigger is modified
this list will be cleared.

=item * C<< $msg->create_time() >> / C<< $msg->create_time($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Protobuf::Timestamp::Timestamp>)

Output only. The creation timestamp of a triggeredJob.

=item * C<< $msg->update_time() >> / C<< $msg->update_time($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Protobuf::Timestamp::Timestamp>)

Output only. The last update timestamp of a triggeredJob.

=item * C<< $msg->last_run_time() >> / C<< $msg->last_run_time($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Protobuf::Timestamp::Timestamp>)

Output only. The timestamp of the last time this trigger executed.

=item * C<< $msg->status() >> / C<< $msg->status($value) >>

Type: C<Enum> (L<Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::JobTrigger::Status>)

Required. A status for this trigger.

=back

=head3 Enum: JobTrigger::Status

=over 4

=item * C<STATUS_UNSPECIFIED> => C<0>

=item * C<HEALTHY> => C<1>

=item * C<PAUSED> => C<2>

=item * C<CANCELLED> => C<3>

=back

