Create a de-identified copy of the input data.

=item * C<< $msg->job_notification_emails() >> / C<< $msg->job_notification_emails($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::Dlp::Action::JobNotificationEmails>)

