Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::Dlp::RelatedResource>)

Resources related to this profile.

=item * C<< $msg->domains() >> / C<< $msg->domains($value) >>

Type: C<Message> (L<Google::Privacy::Dlp::V2::Dlp::Domain>)

